{"id":"u-3aca3236-4c10-41bb-aec9-8b44e5892ecf","src":"community","title":"Cogito Ergo Pump (extended)","author":"Pan Jan","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/7TOiOx-cogito-ergo-pump-full-body-4-days-1","desc":"Cogito Ergo Pump is a 12-week full body hypertrophy programme built for experienced, analytical lifters who want to understand why every set exists, not just execute it.\nFour training days per week — Heavy, Unilateral, Volume, Metabolic — each with a fixed stimulus principle and a distinct progression mechanism. Exercise selection rotates across three 4-week miniblocks (Alfa, Beta, Gamma), providing fresh mechanical stimuli every three weeks while keeping the architecture stable enough for genuine double progression per exercise.\nEvery muscle group trains four times per week at or above minimum effective volume. Legs are integrated rather than isolated — no dedicated leg day, no wasted slots. The brachialis gets its own dedicated slot. The push:pull ratio is defended on every session. Rest interval manipulation governs metabolic sessions rather than chasing arbitrary load increases.\nThis is not a programme you survive. It is a programme you think your way through.","level":["Novice","Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":80,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-08-04T18:34:28.363Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Heavy (Bilateral Strength)","UNILATERAL (Stability)","VOLUME (Accumulation)","METABOLIC (Density, Pump)"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":4,"hi":7,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"lo":4,"hi":7,"rpe":10,"x":3}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Leg Press","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Seated Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":4,"hi":7,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Tricep Rope Push Down (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Barbell Ro